>","content_alignment":"adapt","mobile_content_alignment":"adapt","text_color_light":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","text_color_dark":"rgba(0,0,0,0)"},"blocks":{}},"collapsible_tab_JUnmbR":{"type":"collapsible-tab","name":"t:sections.featured-product.blocks.collapsible_tab.name","settings":{"desktop_width":"100","mobile_width":"100","open_by_default":false,"icon":"another_icon","another_icon":"","custom_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/38.svg","custom_icon":"","use_secondary_background":false,"heading":"Teste erst einmal zuhause","tab_content":"<p>Trage deine CLYPS in den ersten Tagen am besten zuhause oder an einem Ort, an dem du sie jederzeit kurz abnehmen und anpassen kannst. Sobald sie zuverlässig sitzen, sind sie bereit für unterwegs.<\/p>","content_alignment":"adapt","mobile_content_alignment":"adapt","text_color_light":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","text_color_dark":"rgba(0,0,0,0)"},"blocks":{}},"collapsible_tab_k37twV":{"type":"collapsible-tab","name":"t:sections.featured-product.blocks.collapsible_tab.name","settings":{"desktop_width":"100","mobile_width":"100","open_by_default":false,"icon":"another_icon","another_icon":"","custom_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/35.svg","custom_icon":"","use_secondary_background":false,"heading":"Beobachten, fühlen, nachjustieren","tab_content":"<p>Gerade am Anfang hilft es, den Sitz deiner CLYPS zwischendurch kurz zu prüfen und bei Bedarf leicht nachzujustieren. Mit jedem Tragen bekommst du ein besseres Gefühl dafür, wie sie an deinem Ohr am besten sitzen und der Umgang wird schnell ganz selbstverständlich.<\/p>","content_alignment":"adapt","mobile_content_alignment":"adapt","text_color_light":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","text_color_dark":"rgba(0,0,0,0)"},"blocks":{}},"collapsible_tab_7HBijE":{"type":"collapsible-tab","name":"t:sections.featured-product.blocks.collapsible_tab.name","settings":{"desktop_width":"100","mobile_width":"100","open_by_default":false,"icon":"another_icon","another_icon":"","custom_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/37.svg","custom_icon":"","use_secondary_background":false,"heading":"Kleine Handgriffe im Alltag","tab_content":"<p>Manchmal streift im Alltag etwas am Ohr entlang – zum Beispiel beim Umziehen, durch einen Schal, eine Kapuze oder lange Haare. Dabei können deine CLYPS leicht  verrutschen. Halte sie in solchen Momenten einfach kurz mit der Hand fest oder prüfe danach einmal den Sitz. So bekommst du schnell ein Gefühl dafür, worauf du achten solltest.<\/p>","content_alignment":"adapt","mobile_content_alignment":"adapt","text_color_light":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","text_color_dark":"rgba(0,0,0,0)"},"blocks":{}},"item_group_pD6Mex":{"type":"item-group","name":"t:sections.flexible-area.blocks.item-group.name","disabled":true,"settings":{"container_type":"flex","content_alignment":"center","mobile_content_alignment":"center","content_position":"center","group_opacity":100,"edges_type":"square","border_column":"none","enable_desktop_slider":false,"swiper_on_mobile":true,"enable_arrow_mobile":false,"auto_play":false,"change_slides_speed":5,"columns_desktop":4,"desktop_width":"75","row_gap":10,"col_gap":10,"padding_left_desktop":0,"padding_right_desktop":0,"padding_top_desktop":0,"padding_bottom_desktop":0,"columns_mobile":"1","mobile_width":"100","row_gap_mobile":10,"col_gap_mobile":10,"padding_left_mobile":0,"padding_right_mobile":0,"padding_top_mobile":0,"padding_bottom_mobile":0,"background_color_light":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","line_border_light":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","background_color_dark":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","line_border_dark":"rgba(0,0,0,0)"},"blocks":{"rich_text_DEthFn":{"type":"rich-text","name":"t:sections.rich-text.name","settings":{"desktop_width":"100","mobile_width":"100","text":"<p>Noch unsicher? Ob Passform, Sitz oder Tragegefühl – wenn etwas nicht gleich perfekt sitzt, schreib uns einfach. Wir finden gemeinsam eine Lösung. 💛<\/p>","text_size":100,"content_alignment":"adapt","mobile_content_alignment":"adapt","text_color_light":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","text_color_dark":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","custom_css":""},"blocks":{}}},